# The two runtime dependencies this capability talks to the cluster and
# evaluates expressions through directly (kubernetes client, jmespath),
# hash-pinned rather than left to the general dependency tree.
# requirements.txt is GENERATED from this file by scripts/gen_pip_hashes.sh
# (uv pip compile --generate-hashes), run
# inside the image's own base (linux/amd64 python:3.12-slim) so the
# resolution matches what the image will actually install.
#
# runwhen-capability (the SDK) and its own deps (pydantic, PyYAML, requests)
# are installed separately, unpinned by hash, the same way
# rw-checks-codecollection installs its SDK layer (`pip install /app`) --
# only the two dependencies below get the stricter treatment, mirroring how
# rw-checks-codecollection hash-pins the *tools* it runs, not the SDK.
